# CPython static core build artifacts.
# Generated in-tree by cmake/BuildPython312.cmake via PCbuild/_freeze_module.vcxproj:
# the python.org source tarball ships only README.txt in these two directories,
# the real content is produced at configure time.
third_party/Python-3.12.2/Python/frozen_modules/*.h
third_party/Python-3.12.2/Python/deepfreeze/deepfreeze.c
third_party/Python-3.12.2/PCbuild/obj/
